try to  normal and you love to see them smiling  even as they think the end is near they  all cheer on Luffy while we see kid and  I think he doesn't really know how to  think about this whole thing he has a  pretty funny expression on his face a  beast pirate is like y'all crazy we're  all done for and I love it when hyogoro  responds and so what if we are legendary  stuff indirect contrast to this we see  usop and Hamlet running panicking and  saying I don't want to die then usop's  further scared when he notices the water  hit him then I'm shocked and a bit  annoyed to see that a Tremor made the  sea Stone nail loose and Orochi is able  to use his devil fruit again it's insane  how much Orochi has been through and how  he's still not dead I was really hoping  last time would be it but now he's up  and about he is on fire so it doesn't  look good for him but he is using his  fruit Powers he decides to at least take  kyori with him and he hopes Odin is  watching as he takes the life of his  dear daughter at the very least it seems  like he's convinced he's not gonna make  it for much longer so that's comforting  I look forward to seeing who is the one  who saves hiri leave your predictions in  the comments and at this point though  like I can't assume oroch is gonna die  100 because this dude just freaking  keeps going the power of mythical zones  it's crazy then Luffy mid-fight with  kaido says Hey Momo and then both Yamato  and Momo are shocked to see Luffy's  giant fist come out of the heavens it  really is depicted like the hand of God  or something like that no doubt that  this is a Godly devil fruit the fist is  way bigger than even the giant form we  saw before it's coded in hockey  including conquerors hockey and it's  dwarfing kaido in size making it look  like he could squish kaido as if he were  a bug Luffy says he's finishing kaido  for good and that onigashima is in the  way and Momo has to move it ASAP we see  a different perspective and Luffy's fist 